  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da93b2e24fcc36c8",
      "translationZh": "我搭建了一个桌面应用框架，用于在本地保存会议笔记，并能利用这些笔记为我的键盘输入提供自动补全，还能通过读取屏幕内容或使用以往的会议笔记，为我的语音输入补充更多上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2bc241fa04c89be",
      "translationZh": "要让它运行良好，同时又不过于打扰人、也不太卡顿，还真费了一番工夫。最近几天，我终于把它做到了可用的程度，所以在这里分享一下。我用不同的模型和量化版本做了大量实验，发现在普通 MacBook 上，6bit 的 Gemma 4 E2B base 在建议质量和低延迟之间取得了最佳平衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c57e2bba170ca9e",
      "translationZh": "功能 Cotypist Cotabby LokalBot",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ce1699f7032ccc5",
      "translationZh": "专有软件，每天可免费使用 100 个词，无限量使用则",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc2a2085d7d529df",
      "translationZh": "本地运行（推荐 Gemma 4 E4B）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56b40e47bda9ca11",
      "translationZh": "通过 llama.cpp 在本地运行 GGUF，或使用 Apple Intelligence",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a70ce0aab74861af",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 4 E2B base Q6_K，进程内运行 llama.cpp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb7d2c6f25dbf4f8",
      "translationZh": "知道你的会议中说过什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90e5dfdeb75624eb",
      "translationZh": "是，需主动启用：当你的草稿提及某个有辨识度的事物时，最多从你自己的笔记中提取两条事实",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "759c5f09959ba916",
      "translationZh": "其网站上未作说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12e6a4b9643bd4d7",
      "translationZh": "输入框上方的无障碍文本，默认启用，绝不从隐私窗口中获取",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70b58d222b7400a9",
      "translationZh": "表情符号、宏、自动更正",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "669a9f2c93035140",
      "translationZh": "会议、听写、屏幕内容回溯，共享同一个模型内存预算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20dd755ed8ab91f4",
      "translationZh": "与 Cotabby 正面对比，782 个下一词预测检查点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b522f6159cac7a3",
      "translationZh": "相同的输入，相同的 Gemma 4 E2B 权重 下一词完全匹配",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a014f786e5ff5f31",
      "translationZh": "+2.0 个百分点（95% 区间为 0.0 至 +4.0）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24be8e2f8e300883",
      "translationZh": "性能方面，它与 CoTabby 相当，不过我还在打磨用户体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f72f7cf2da6a2b57",
      "translationZh": "如果你试用了它，我很想听听它帮你编写代码的效果：你用的是哪种语言，以及它给出的建议有多大用处。另外，如果你知道有哪个小型基础模型能在约 50 ms 的耗时下胜过 Gemma 4 E2B，我会对它进行基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11f6dcf6300f05c7",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/stevyhacker 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
